* `tropicalKernel` — the tropical kernel of a behavior table
* `HasFactorizationRankAtMost` — the key rank predicate
* `tropical_operadic_kernel_duality` — the main equivalence theorem
* `certified_minimal_reconstruction` — existence of a minimal realization
* `factorization_rank_compose_le` — sub-multiplicativity under composition

Bridge: tropical algebra ↔ operadic ML ↔ kernel methods ↔ realization theory
-/

